  <item>
    <title>vol.41 手机内存怎么又爆炸了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6834510438dcc57c640a0077</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6834510438dcc57c640a0077</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播说】</span><br><span>手机内存紧急‼️告急</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚开始准备清理相册，又莫名其妙陷入“回忆杀”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人在备忘录里摘抄段子，有人把备忘录当成草稿纸，难怪手机内存会爆炸。</span></p><span></span><p><span>再开始清理微信，文件传输助手已经把我这辈子看透了。（这一段就是在传输助手里打的）</span></p><span></span><p><span>各种app的收藏夹更是宛如电子垃圾厂，其实很多收藏都是为了缓解焦虑而不是真的有用到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>还好我们找到了一些收藏夹整理大法，快来听听看吧！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期你将听到】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">00:02:17</a>:手机老是内存不足，把它像广告一样关掉就可以了😌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">00:05:04</a>:清理手机相册时总会陷入回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">00:13:45</a>:回到最原始的方式—把照片打出来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">00:15:42</a>:不会真有人在备忘录里背段子吧？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">00:25:49</a>:我已经猜出大部分人的账户密码了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">00:29:30</a>:微信文件传输助手—知道我秘密最多的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2379">00:39:39</a>:珍藏回忆：在日记本中发现意想不到的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">00:46:15</a>:还会翻看手机里曾经写过的文字和照片？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3172">00:52:52</a>:收藏夹宛如电子垃圾厂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">00:59:31</a>:收藏夹里的东西真的有用吗？还是为了缓解焦虑？还是有情感依赖？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3968">01:06:08</a>:我得收拾收拾我的收藏夹了，收藏夹整理大法来也！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4605">01:16:45</a>:听到这的朋友，都来立一个有关整理收藏夹的flag🚩</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 《删了吧》郁可唯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 豆子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期文案】</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 豆子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【如何找到我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>*小红书：零分无限</span><br><span>*公众号：百分七的阳光</span></p><span></span><p><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
