  <item>
    <title>vol.37 回家过年——过没有三十的年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67984fc0247d51713cade07f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67984fc0247d51713cade07f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 03:58:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播说：</span></strong><br><span>在这期播客中，我们三位主播在除夕前夕相聚，讨论了过年那些事。从儿时对春节的热爱，到如今烟花禁放、春晚质量下滑，年味变淡的感受。我们还聊到了走亲戚的社恐烦恼，以及各地不同的过年习俗。你是否也有同样的经历？一起听听我们的故事，找回那些属于春节的美好回忆。祝大家除夕平安，新年都有好事发生！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期你将听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">00:05:47</a>:红包传统：亲戚间的礼物交流与家庭关系的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">00:11:37</a>:南北方春节期间的拜访方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1394">00:23:14</a>:如何看待现在的亲戚关系：从幼时玩伴到如今的疏远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1743">00:29:03</a>:南北方春节座次安排的交往之道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2093">00:34:53</a>:必不可少的家乡春节美食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">00:40:42</a>:外皮脆脆的甜口菜肴，绝对不能错过的糖衣茄子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2791">00:46:31</a>:豆子的2024年度关键词：得到与阳光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">00:52:20</a>:韩国济州岛航空事件引发的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3837">01:03:57</a>:拾柒谈成立播客以来的影响和收获</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*好好生活就是美好生活——周深</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期剪辑】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>* 豆子&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期文案】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>* 豆子 鱿鱼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【如何找到我】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*小红书：零分无限</span></p>]]></description>
