  <item>
    <title>vol.33 记者特辑｜我们是自己生活里的记者</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674191688d1233fb0d651707</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674191688d1233fb0d651707</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播说】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>零分无限主播们拥有自己的生活，我们是自己生活里的记者，记录自己的生活，本期记者特辑分为</span><strong><span>生活频道，职场安全频道，教育频道，</span></strong><span>根据频道记者的经验总结，在本期进行分享。真实感受与经历，希望可以帮助到大家，也希望能引发大家的思考，欢迎评论区留言。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期记者】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*豆子-生活频道</span></p><span></span><p><span>*拾柒-职场安全频道</span></p><span></span><p><span>*鱿鱼-教育频道</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期你将听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:00:09</a>:记者豆子带来生活频道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">00:02:12</a>:洗洁精的多种妙用：去油膜、除臭、除湿，更多惊喜等待发现！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">00:04:15</a>:旅游必备小窍门：如何快速解冻冷冻食品和防止酒店偷拍？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">00:06:16</a>:创意旅行：用便利贴标记酒店插座，安全出行更安心！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">00:08:39</a>:记者拾柒带来职场安全频道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">00:08:47</a>:职场小妙招：保护自己的安全意识，远离冒犯和危险！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">00:11:50</a>:记者鱿鱼带来的记者频道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">00:12:21</a>:教育的两种倾向：尼采教育何为的批判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">00:14:25</a>:教育的真相：提升能力而非学历！——尼采的观点与实践</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">00:16:26</a>:哲学的精彩之处：真正的文学教师的责任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">00:18:27</a>:韩国女子大学的变革：男女教育平等与个人利益的抉择</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期提及】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Friedrich·Wilhelm·Nietzsche（弗里德里希·威廉·尼采）-《教育何为？》</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6ZmlsZTovLy9DOlxVc2Vyc1w2N1xBcHBEYXRhXExvY2FsXFRlbXBca3NvaHRtbDIwNDBcd3BzMS5wbmc=.png"><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*Heize-Falling（片尾）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期剪辑】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*鱿鱼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期文案】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*鱿鱼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【美术设计】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*陆拾柒</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【如何找到我】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*小红书：零分无限</span></p>]]></description>
