    <title>vol.31 女性专场 从什么时候开始发现你的风格变了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6729793b33c798676f7d6360</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6729793b33c798676f7d6360</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Nov 2024 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播说】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>上学会因为学校允许留长发感到恩赐，这种为了学习的谎言会被大家套用在很多事身上，但其实不被强制的改变外貌，才是合理的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而我们自身的外在形象也不应该成为评判一个人的标准，以貌取人，字如其人的这些先入为主的揣测，往往会让你错过一个好人或者发现一个颠覆认知的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期零分无限的女性话题就来讨论那些被剥夺的自我样貌取悦，以及这种现象造成的影响。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*拾柒</span></p><span></span><p><span>*豆子</span></p><span></span><p><span>*鱿鱼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期你将听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:00:43</a>:女性人物：杨妞花，黄阿丽的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">00:08:48</a>:孕妈妈摆脱固有打扮形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">00:13:09</a>:校园对于外形的初教育：头发会影响你学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">00:17:37</a>:审美潜移默化，思想总是固化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">00:26:27</a>:隐形眼镜，招风耳：其实没有“好坏”之分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">00:30:53</a>:吃出你的好心情：胖也会被说，瘦也会被说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">00:35:16</a>:大码和小码女装：女性服装尺寸标准到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2646">00:44:06</a>:悦人先悦己：长美甲总被问会不会不方便</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2912">00:48:32</a>:男性化妆：追求美是人之常情</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【女性人物】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*</span><strong><span>杨妞花</span></strong><span>-正义永远不会缺席!!!一个5岁被拐卖后花了 26 年回家的人5 岁被拐卖，亲生父母含恨而终</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNZH1VEd5uCvrc814CmNF1DfnEx.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>*</span><strong><span>黄阿丽</span></strong><span>-真·爽文女主，亚裔脱口秀女演员 金球奖最佳女主角</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkIeK8lOfgDwl8YSV4GPjJ6mCATz.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>* 孟佳- 她是谁（片头）</span></p><span></span><p><span>*孟佳- Something Worth Saving(插曲1）</span></p><span></span><p><span>*Colbie Caillat- Try（插曲2）</span></p><span></span><p><span>*Selena Gomez &amp; The Scene- Who Says（片尾）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期剪辑】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*鱿鱼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期文案】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*鱿鱼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【美术设计】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*陆拾柒</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【如何找到我】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>*</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/641332d500000000110219c5?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c0ccd980000000006016fbe&amp;apptime=1721095318&amp;share_id=fc539fba23ce4f10a0aedaa7f8875981" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/641332d500000000110219c5?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c0ccd980000000006016fbe&amp;apptime=1721095318&amp;share_id=fc539fba23ce4f10a0aedaa7f8875981"><u><span>小红书：零分无限</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><span>*</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7920308408" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7920308408"><u><span>Weibo：零分无限</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
